{"id":"wb-6-696","name":"玉台山石塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"玉臺山石塔","text":"玉台山石塔，又称滕王亭子石塔，位于四川省南充市阆中市，文物遗址年代判定为唐。2002年12月27日，作为阆中古建筑群之一公布为第六批四川省文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E8%87%BA%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93101429,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93101429","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c5b2fd119ae783d7e717926a.jpg","title":"Tengwangting_Zishita_20260510.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tengwangting_Zishita_20260510.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Tengwangting_Zishita_20260510.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Suicasmo","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"Tengwangting Zishita","width":320,"height":480}}